WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.850
It's from morning to night!

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:06.650
Oh no! Next!

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:09.110
1, 2, 3, 4, 5!  A, B, C, D, E, F, G!

00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:11.190
1, 2, 3-way scramble!

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:13.610
Yoohoo!

00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:15.740
Yay! Yay!

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:18.280
Yahoo!

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:19.990
Let's go!

00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:20.580
*gobble gobble*

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:21.120
*tip tap*

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:21.910
*huff puff*

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.210
Alright! I'm all full from breakfast!

00:00:24.210 --> 00:00:26.380
Gather everyone and let's go to school!

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:28.590
Monday makes me sleepy

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:30.670
I'll feign sick and it'll be Sunday!

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:32.970
Yeah! We've got field trips and sports days!

00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:35.090
I'm so excited that I couldn't sleep!

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:37.260
There's a storm and typhoon warning!

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:39.640
It will be pushed back five days!

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:42.980
Tests?! No way! I don't want them!

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:48.400
I can't escape! My mind and answer sheet are both blank!

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:52.740
Let's nap in the infirmary!

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:54.820
Yes! Food time! Three servings of curry rice!

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:56.990
More! More! I want more!

00:00:56.990 --> 00:00:59.240
My body's growing, so is my appetite!

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:01.370
1, 2, 3 and GO!

00:01:01.370 --> 00:01:03.540
I'm all ready!

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:06.420
Let's start our awesome day today!

00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:10.090
I can't stop myself! I won't stop myself!

00:01:10.090 --> 00:01:12.300
Let's all go wild!

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:16.630
Extraterritoriality? What's that?

00:01:16.630 --> 00:01:20.930
I'm an elementary schooler!

00:01:20.930 --> 00:01:23.180
It's autumn and winter!

00:01:23.180 --> 00:01:25.350
They're great! Next!

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:30.020
1, 2, 3-way scramble!

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:35.030
The Silent Classroom

00:01:36.070 --> 00:01:37.530
Sounds fake.

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:39.410
It's true!

00:01:39.410 --> 00:01:42.700
If you write your crush's name on an eraser and use it all up,

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:44.660
he'll like you back!

00:01:45.160 --> 00:01:47.670
You're really into these charms and stuff, aren't you?

00:01:49.290 --> 00:01:49.920
You hear that?

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:51.710
Every last word.

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:56.380
I'll write Satou's name on every eraser I have and rub them all out!

00:01:56.380 --> 00:01:57.680
Yeah!

00:02:03.350 --> 00:02:06.310
Oga, why are you cutting up your eraser?

00:02:06.310 --> 00:02:09.980
One eraser gets me his breath...

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:13.730
Two erasers gets me a lock of his hair...

00:02:14.070 --> 00:02:16.990
Three, I get his used straw...

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:20.240
Four erasers and I get to talk to him...

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:22.490
Five erasers and I get to touch him...

00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:23.990
She's twisting the rules!

00:02:32.920 --> 00:02:34.840
Okay, everyone, sit down.

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:43.680
You dropped this, Satou.

00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:44.510
Thanks.

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:48.930
T-This is...

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:52.100
Satou, you've got a crush on Itou?!

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:52.690
Huh?

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:55.690
Her name's on your eraser!

00:02:55.690 --> 00:02:56.480
Eh?

00:02:58.860 --> 00:03:00.450
W-What the heck?

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:02.870
I don't remember writing this!

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:04.330
Don't deny it!

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:06.410
I had no idea.

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:07.830
What a surprise.

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:11.000
Ahh! What should I do?

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:12.830
O-Oga...

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:17.130
What to do?!

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:21.760
This wasn't written by Satou.

00:03:23.470 --> 00:03:26.890
Come on, you can't just outright deny it!

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:27.680
Look.

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:30.770
This is water-based ink.

00:03:30.770 --> 00:03:32.850
What about it?

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:35.020
Satou's pen is oil-based.

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:38.230
Hey, it really is.

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:39.940
Wait, why do you know that?!

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:42.360
The only one who had something to gain from doing this...

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:44.910
...is you, Shiori!

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:46.910
T-That's...

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:51.460
Oh, yeah! That must be my eraser!

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:55.710
Nope, this is without a doubt Satou's eraser.

00:03:55.920 --> 00:04:01.220
It carries his scent...so sweet, with just a touch of bitterness.

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:03.630
It really is!

00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:05.220
Just give it back!

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:08.510
You've a lot to learn, Shiori.

00:04:17.110 --> 00:04:18.770
Stand up, Shiori.

00:04:19.230 --> 00:04:22.610
We all share the same love for Satou.

00:04:22.990 --> 00:04:24.160
Oga...

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:26.490
You'll forgive me?

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:29.580
Of course. Aren't we best friends?

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:31.750
And...

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:34.000
Rivals in love!

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:36.500
O-Oga...

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:42.010
U-Um...

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:46.010
Let's finish off our erasers!

00:04:46.010 --> 00:04:46.840
Yeah!

00:04:47.430 --> 00:04:49.760
Hey, where did mine go?

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:52.100
I did so many of them!

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:54.350
Eh? Really?

00:04:57.610 --> 00:04:59.020
That over there...

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:00.730
It couldn't be...?

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:05.910
Don't worry, it's just a silly superstition anyway.

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:08.450
Yeah, you're right!

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:21.420
This is like waiting for your turn with the executioner...

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:22.380
Totally...

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:26.430
My mom's coming to the next class... and she's way too pumped up.

00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:34.770
I can't wait to see all the weird kids in class 6-3!

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:37.020
Our class isn't a zoo!

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:39.650
Could you please at least wear normal clothes?!

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:42.270
But these are so much easier to move in!

00:05:42.270 --> 00:05:44.400
You don't have to move at all!

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:47.280
Weirdo kids!

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:48.660
Freaky kids!.

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:50.200
What weird kids will I see this time?

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:52.620
I-can't-wait!

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:56.910
I'm so depressed...

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:01.420
I arrived early because I was so excited.

00:06:01.420 --> 00:06:03.590
I wonder if Miku will get mad at me?

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:06.050
At least she's got her looks!

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:08.380
I'm so depressed...

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:12.640
I arrived early because I was so excited.

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:14.890
I wonder if Mitsuba will get mad at me?

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:15.850
Papa!

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:18.020
Futaba!

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:22.230
You're not going in?

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:25.360
Mitsuba will get mad at me.

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:28.740
Then disguise yourself so no one can tell it's you!

00:06:29.110 --> 00:06:30.740
A disguise, eh?

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:39.420
I'll sneak in to take a peek at the weird kids! Let's go!

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:41.750
Gotta pee! Gotta pee!

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:44.000
I'm so excited!

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:47.550
Those huge prayer beads...

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:52.800
She's the one whom they deem as the strangest in the whole class, the occult fanatic Matsuoka!

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:55.890
Wow, you got a perfect score on the math test?

00:06:55.890 --> 00:06:58.560
That's rare... Was it the work of the spirits?

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:01.190
Nope, it's all my own hard work.

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:03.270
It's no good to blame everything on spirits.

00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:07.990
The 50 marks I got for humanities was totally their fault, though.

00:07:07.990 --> 00:07:10.240
She's a little different from what I pictured...

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:11.160
Huh?

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:14.200
Oh, it's the trio obsessed with Satou!

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:19.160
What crazy scheme are they up to?

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:23.290
They're just studying.

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:26.170
They're pretty serious about school.

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:40.100
This weight...!

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:43.480
Yes! Mitsuba's just how I imagined!

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:48.440
I'm so jealous of your mom, Sugi.

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:51.030
She's so beautiful, and her body's great too!

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:55.700
Well, she's kind of weird, but her looks give her a free pass on everything!

00:07:55.700 --> 00:07:56.740
You don't get it!

00:07:57.950 --> 00:08:00.000
Every parent's day...

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:03.210
she only comes to look at other kids, not me.

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:12.630
M-Miku...

00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:13.970
Mama?!

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:15.220
I'm sorry.

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:18.510
Apologize to me now!

00:08:20.640 --> 00:08:24.900
It's just that there's nothing weird about you.

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:26.520
I'm sorry.

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:28.230
Mom...

00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:34.860
Next time we go shopping, I'll buy you a whole store's worth of your favorite brand!

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:37.240
No, two! I want two stores worth!

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:43.540
All the kids in 6-3 seem to be nice and normal!

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:45.540
Huh? Really?

00:08:45.870 --> 00:08:48.500
Yes! All perfectly norm-

00:08:51.590 --> 00:08:54.170
Class 6-3 is fascinating!

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:58.930
Morning, Shin!

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:01.310
Oh, morning.

00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:02.680
Hey...

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:04.020
Here!

00:09:07.770 --> 00:09:10.770
Hey, that was your Valentine's chocolate...

00:09:10.770 --> 00:09:12.030
Chocolate?!

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:14.320
Put it in something better, you idiot!

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:23.500
Huh? It's good.

00:09:26.170 --> 00:09:28.170
It tastes way better than it looks!

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:30.460
Y-You freak!

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:34.210
Is that... dog poop?!

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:38.300
Of course not! It's chocolate!

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:40.220
It's chocolate from Futaba!

00:09:40.220 --> 00:09:43.430
Oh yeah, she was making some the other night.

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:48.650
Speaking of which, I've got a good supply myself.

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:51.190
Though I haven't decided who to give it to yet.

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:52.940
Oh.

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:58.030
Beg me for it!

00:09:58.030 --> 00:09:59.700
Don't want it!

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:01.660
But you ate Futaba's!

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:04.620
T-That's... S-She made it for me...

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:08.920
No, I made it for Papa and had some leftovers.

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:13.550
Ooh, did someone get the wrong idea? How embarrassing!

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:19.510
I'll get loads of chocolate even without you two!

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:21.350
Ya jerks!

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:24.600
You hear that?

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:25.850
He should just die.

00:10:27.180 --> 00:10:31.150
There's a lot of sad little boys who never get any chocolate.

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:36.400
Even though I didn't make it for anyone in particular...

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:39.530
cutting it, boiling it...

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:44.790
It was pretty hard, you know!

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:47.370
I wonder if anyone will give me some.

00:10:47.370 --> 00:10:49.620
Don't give up hope.

00:10:50.670 --> 00:10:53.920
They're gourmet chocolates, 500 yen each!

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:56.170
Wow, so good!

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:57.920
They even taste classy!

00:10:58.220 --> 00:11:00.340
Why are you giving chocolate to girls?

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:01.640
Are you into girls?

00:11:01.640 --> 00:11:04.560
They're chocolates for friends, to mark our friendship!

00:11:06.770 --> 00:11:08.890
Hmm, which should I try?

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:13.480
This stuff ain't that great for gourmet chocolate.

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:16.980
My homemade chocolate is a hundred times tastier!

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:17.990
SERIOUS?!

00:11:17.990 --> 00:11:20.240
L-Let me try a piece!

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:24.030
You think I'm gonna waste my chocolate on you?!

00:11:27.660 --> 00:11:30.370
Since when are we friends?

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:32.750
C-Cheapskate!

00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:35.250
You think I'm gonna waste my chocolate on you?!

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:39.550
She stole my line...

00:11:41.260 --> 00:11:42.470
She's crying...

00:11:42.470 --> 00:11:44.470
Give her one...

00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:47.430
F-Fine, just one.

00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:54.480
I'm gonna disgrace this choc!

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:01.860
So good...

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:04.280
Good for you.

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:06.780
N-No, it's nothing-

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:10.250
E-Erm... Can I have one more?

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:13.500
You expect me to waste <i>two</i> on you?!

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:19.000
She stole my line again!

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:32.020
Ugh... I'm so stupid...

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:34.140
W-What's the matter?

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:37.020
Tomorrow's White Day!

00:12:37.020 --> 00:12:38.770
Y-You're right...

00:12:39.190 --> 00:12:40.730
White Day...

00:12:40.730 --> 00:12:44.450
The day when new couples come together!

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:49.330
If I'd just given chocolates to some random boys on Valentine's...

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:53.160
I would've got a whole bunch in return tomorrow!

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:58.130
Oh yeah! Let's give Sugi something for her chocolates!

00:12:58.130 --> 00:13:00.210
Those gourmet chocolates were really delicious!

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:04.760
Do you really have to do that for friendship chocolate?

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:08.390
You really should, if just the thought of it makes you drool like that...

00:13:08.390 --> 00:13:12.430
Then let's bake her some cookies or something after school today.

00:13:12.430 --> 00:13:14.310
We have to keep it secret though!

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:15.600
What'cha talking about?

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:20.650
N-Nothing! She was just saying how hungry she was!

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:21.690
Yoshioka!

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:26.070
We'll go to Mitsuba's house-

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:28.570
What're you gonna do at her house?

00:13:29.450 --> 00:13:30.830
I'll go too!

00:13:30.830 --> 00:13:31.990
You can't!

00:13:31.990 --> 00:13:34.660
My house is too small. There's only room for these two!

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:35.910
Mitsuba...

00:13:35.910 --> 00:13:38.040
She's been there with us a bunch of times...

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:41.040
Just come over to my house if you're gonna do homework!

00:13:41.590 --> 00:13:43.380
No, umm...

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:44.550
Sorry...

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:51.810
If you like Mitsuba so much... why don't you marry her?!

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:53.430
Our friendship's over!

00:13:54.220 --> 00:13:55.600
Sugi...

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:58.770
We can make up with her tomorrow after we make the cookies.

00:14:02.020 --> 00:14:03.780
And that's the story.

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:07.240
Why did they suddenly leave me out?

00:14:07.240 --> 00:14:09.240
Sugi, could you...

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:11.490
possibly be...

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:12.780
dead?

00:14:12.780 --> 00:14:13.910
HUH?!

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:17.790
There are some ghosts that don't realize they're dead.

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:19.710
You might be one of them!

00:14:19.710 --> 00:14:22.500
I shouldn't have asked you in the first place.

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:25.550
Hey, you two!

00:14:26.420 --> 00:14:30.300
Check out my new watch! It cost 300,000 yen!

00:14:31.760 --> 00:14:32.890
It's nice.

00:14:33.810 --> 00:14:36.770
You should be squealing in awe!

00:14:36.770 --> 00:14:38.730
Like Yoshioka...

00:14:39.640 --> 00:14:41.860
Did you see your life flash before your eyes?

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:42.610
What?!

00:14:42.610 --> 00:14:43.940
A light at the end of a tunnel?

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:45.400
An endless meadow?

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:46.570
The River Styx?!

00:14:46.570 --> 00:14:48.990
W-What's with you all of a sudden?!

00:14:48.990 --> 00:14:52.240
When I started thinking you might be dead, my heart just started pounding!

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:54.330
Someone help!

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:01.460
Satsuko?

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:02.380
Hmm?

00:15:02.380 --> 00:15:04.210
Have you seen Sugi?

00:15:04.210 --> 00:15:08.090
We all made her some cookies last night.

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:13.640
As of yesterday, Sugi belongs to me and me alone.

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:14.640
What?!

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:17.850
I'll take your offering in her stead.

00:15:18.180 --> 00:15:19.600
Offering?

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:23.400
So Satsuko and Sugi were in <i>that</i> kind of relationship?!

00:15:23.400 --> 00:15:25.730
Come to think of it, they were glomping pretty hard yesterday...

00:15:25.730 --> 00:15:27.280
T-That's sick!

00:15:27.730 --> 00:15:30.610
Oh, Sugi!

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:32.280
There's that sicko!

00:15:32.280 --> 00:15:34.620
I-It's not what you think!

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:37.740
She thinks I'm dead because you losers ignored me!

00:15:37.740 --> 00:15:38.660
Huh?

00:15:38.660 --> 00:15:41.120
You guys can see Sugi?

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:42.170
Yeah.

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:43.750
So she's not dead?!

00:15:45.130 --> 00:15:46.670
I don't get her.

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:49.010
Actually, yesterday we-

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:51.430
Don't beat around the bush, just get to the point!

00:15:52.180 --> 00:15:54.680
You all hate me, don't you?

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:56.680
'Cuz I brag about all my stuff,

00:15:56.680 --> 00:15:58.680
and flaunt my new clothes...

00:15:58.680 --> 00:16:01.180
Why didn't you just tell me if you didn't like it?!

00:16:08.020 --> 00:16:11.610
I never thought of it as bragging.

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:15.950
Your clothes are really cute, and they look good on you.

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:19.080
I really envy you!

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:20.830
Then why-

00:16:21.120 --> 00:16:24.080
We were making you some cookies in secret,

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:26.080
in return for Valentine's Day!

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:34.260
You didn't have to do that.

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:36.010
How about some gratitude?!

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:38.350
All <i>you</i> did was to taste them.

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:40.680
So, where are these cookies?

00:16:40.680 --> 00:16:42.850
Satsuko ran off with them.

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:51.690
M-My cookies!

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:54.360
You don't need offerings if you aren't dead!

00:16:54.360 --> 00:16:56.950
Sugi, we can always make some more...

00:16:58.070 --> 00:17:01.330
Cookie!

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:04.250
Sugi!

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:06.040
It's so good!

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:09.000
I... I...

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:12.510
I'm not interested in the living!

00:17:12.760 --> 00:17:14.510
Sugi, you sicko!

00:17:14.510 --> 00:17:16.430
You're a sicko!

00:17:16.430 --> 00:17:17.550
Don't kick her when she's down...

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:20.470
T-There's all kinds of love!

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:22.140
You've got the wrong idea, too.

00:17:28.860 --> 00:17:31.860
Okay girls, it's time to start the physical checkup!

00:17:40.280 --> 00:17:42.660
D-Don't worry, Mitsuba!

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:45.120
We're all growing, so it's natural to gain weight!

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:47.790
Yoshioka!

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:50.090
We don't know if she's gained weight yet.

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:52.000
Well, she probably <i>has</i>, but-

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:53.380
I CAN HEAR YOU!

00:17:54.340 --> 00:17:57.930
I haven't gained weight. My stomach just stood out a little, that's all.

00:17:57.930 --> 00:17:59.840
And you accept that?

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:01.850
Okay, next up is Mitsuba.

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:11.690
De-fense! De-fense!

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:12.400
D-Don't look!

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:13.650
We won't.

00:18:13.650 --> 00:18:16.240
We couldn't see even if you weren't hiding it!

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:16.240
De-fense, de-fense!

00:18:16.490 --> 00:18:17.530
That's right.

00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:19.450
Her stomach would still be in the way.

00:18:19.450 --> 00:18:21.870
That's not what I meant!

00:18:21.870 --> 00:18:23.620
Say whatever you want!

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:27.080
Mitsuba, you're 42.5 kilograms.

00:18:29.370 --> 00:18:31.880
You worthless excuse for a nurse!

00:18:31.880 --> 00:18:34.210
Y-You told me to say it!

00:18:34.210 --> 00:18:36.380
We weren't listening! We weren't listening!

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:39.220
It's alright! It's lighter than I thought!

00:18:39.220 --> 00:18:40.680
Yoshioka!!

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:49.310
The infirmary is a paradise right now...

00:18:49.310 --> 00:18:51.520
They're probably at the bust measurements now,

00:18:51.520 --> 00:18:56.030
and the girls will say, "My boobs got bigger again!"

00:18:57.530 --> 00:18:59.400
They don't measure the bust yet.

00:18:59.400 --> 00:19:03.070
Okay! Let's take this chance to rank the girls in our class!

00:19:03.070 --> 00:19:05.080
Yeah!

00:19:05.080 --> 00:19:07.040
You shouldn't rank people.

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:08.660
Shut it, honor student!

00:19:08.870 --> 00:19:12.580
So, who do you think is the cutest in our class?

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:16.340
No one in particular...

00:19:16.340 --> 00:19:18.630
Like I thought, his standards are pretty high.

00:19:18.630 --> 00:19:20.590
He could have any girl he wants.

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:22.260
Drop dead, pretty boy!

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:23.300
Chiba!

00:19:23.300 --> 00:19:26.680
What do you think of the eldest Marui girl, Mr. Pretty Boy?

00:19:27.930 --> 00:19:29.810
W-Well...

00:19:29.810 --> 00:19:32.230
See, you do think you're a hunk.

00:19:32.230 --> 00:19:33.520
Shut it.

00:19:33.520 --> 00:19:36.190
W-Well, she's all right, when she shuts up.

00:19:38.230 --> 00:19:39.740
How about Yoshioka?

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:41.450
She's not bad when she's not talking.

00:19:41.450 --> 00:19:42.780
How about Sugisaki?

00:19:42.780 --> 00:19:44.070
If she'd shut up.

00:19:44.070 --> 00:19:45.450
Itou Shiori?

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:47.450
If she weren't a diehard Satou fan.

00:19:47.450 --> 00:19:49.950
Miyashi... Miyaoka?

00:19:49.950 --> 00:19:52.710
Wait, wasn't it Miyazaki?

00:19:52.710 --> 00:19:54.040
How about Matsuoka?

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:55.880
She <i>really</i> needs to be quiet.

00:19:57.550 --> 00:20:00.970
If only the girls from our class would just shut up.

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:03.340
Yeah. Exactly.

00:20:03.800 --> 00:20:06.100
Next, we'll measure your height!

00:20:06.350 --> 00:20:08.390
You might've grown just a teensy bit taller.

00:20:08.390 --> 00:20:11.940
I really don't care how tall I am.

00:20:14.310 --> 00:20:16.520
You so do.

00:20:16.520 --> 00:20:18.360
Next, Hitoha!

00:20:22.400 --> 00:20:23.410
Oops...

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:32.750
Umm... 150.2 centimeters.

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:34.040
Cheater...

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:39.550
I see... You have to use her klutziness against her.

00:20:40.050 --> 00:20:45.300
Nurse! I lost my record, will you weigh me again?

00:20:45.550 --> 00:20:47.550
Sure!

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:55.480
82 kilograms.

00:20:56.350 --> 00:20:58.190
Mitsuba's like a top sumo!

00:20:58.190 --> 00:21:01.150
H-Hold on, do it again!

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:06.990
92 kilograms.

00:21:11.240 --> 00:21:16.370
Looks like we all got bad news; I got taller again.

00:21:16.370 --> 00:21:18.080
That's a nice problem to have.

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:21.380
I got heavier again.

00:21:21.380 --> 00:21:24.300
My height when seated increased... it must be an evil spirit.

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:26.430
She caught me... I'll curse her.

00:21:45.650 --> 00:21:49.030
You were listening in on our conversation earlier, weren't you?!

00:21:49.410 --> 00:21:51.830
You sneaky girls!

00:21:53.540 --> 00:21:54.330
Huh?

00:21:54.620 --> 00:21:56.040
Drop dead, pretty boy!

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:57.330
That's wrong!

00:21:57.920 --> 00:22:00.340
And you get that off the bus...

00:22:00.710 --> 00:22:03.590
How come Miya-something is so tall?

00:22:04.340 --> 00:22:07.430
I should ask her what her diet's like.

00:22:08.840 --> 00:22:10.890
"Would you tell me about your diet?"

00:22:10.890 --> 00:22:12.680
"Would you tell me your diet?"

00:22:13.720 --> 00:22:16.100
What's up, Hitoha? You need something?

00:22:17.140 --> 00:22:18.520
Would you die?

00:22:22.520 --> 00:22:24.230
W-Whoops...

00:22:38.340 --> 00:22:43.680
The three-minute rule says this candy's still safe to eat!

00:22:44.100 --> 00:22:50.650
Really, aren't you tired of making a fuss about this every time?

00:22:49.610 --> 00:22:50.650
Yeah!

00:22:50.650 --> 00:22:56.110
Just stop showing me that pretense of kindness

00:22:56.110 --> 00:22:59.370
Will it do good in the long term? You ask

00:22:59.370 --> 00:23:01.700
It's none of your business!

00:23:01.830 --> 00:23:05.160
Inspection time for all~

00:23:05.160 --> 00:23:07.670
Haven't seen that before? Does it even exist?

00:23:08.250 --> 00:23:09.000
Let's check it out!

00:23:08.580 --> 00:23:12.130
Everyone's perfectly uniform!

00:23:11.250 --> 00:23:12.130
Yeah! Yeah!

00:23:12.130 --> 00:23:17.180
That's why we're straying from the path... Hurry!

00:23:14.260 --> 00:23:15.170
Go! Go!

00:23:17.180 --> 00:23:21.430
It's a good day for new encounters

00:23:21.430 --> 00:23:29.600
Next week's sparkling if you feel the weak pulse!

00:23:29.600 --> 00:23:36.650
Let's have a good sleep!

00:23:36.650 --> 00:23:41.910
Once you're fully rested and recharged

00:23:42.490 --> 00:23:45.830
Let's go backpacking!

00:23:57.840 --> 00:23:59.500
What's wrong, Matsuoka?

00:23:59.500 --> 00:24:02.220
Why are you alive, Sugi?

00:24:02.220 --> 00:24:04.080
What's wrong with me being alive?!

00:24:04.080 --> 00:24:05.890
Hmm? Then maybe next time.

00:24:04.830 --> 00:24:09.960
If The Bathroom's Locked, Use The Snow

00:24:05.890 --> 00:24:09.430
Don't make such creepy previews!
